  "notes": [
    "type: the element's type slug; element: the keys a reader sees on the body (supertype and x_spine_*).",
    "read: what a conforming reader of one element says. kind: the list's spelling, 'off-list', or 'free' (Character, Institution, Collective).",
    "Each key is its value as read, or null when not stated. primary: the audience's first known word. probe: the verb ('http', 'gh repo', 'gh release', 'npm', 'pypi', 'dns', 'room', 'file', 'none') or 'unsupported'.",
    "dropped: what the reader named and left out, as '<key>: <the value as JSON>', in key order address, access, status, layer, audience, depends_on, verified.",
    "Not here: whether an id resolves, one owner per row, a Retirement Event: the world's audit, never a reader of one element."
